# AI Prompt — Build Enterprise Document Template Module (Phase 1)

We are building an enterprise accounting system in Java Spring Boot.

The Invoice module already exists and is functional.

We are **NOT** implementing PDF generation or email sending in this phase.

This phase is only for implementing a reusable **Document Template Module** that will later be used by Invoices, Quotes, Credit Notes, Purchase Orders, Receipts, etc.

The implementation must follow clean architecture and SOLID principles.

---

# Goal

Create a new module called:

```
Document Template
```

This module will manage how business documents are rendered and emailed in the future.

Initially it will support Invoice templates, but the design must support other document types without modification.

